// The boss's combo, an odd cut after the first: 62 ticks
// (docs/architecture.md section 11, "模型和动画"): the wait before the cut
// 0-12 (the default combo_gap_ticks), active 12-17, recovery 17-62. Each
// part has keyframes at its ends. Rotations are YXZ degrees about each
// bone's position along the model's axes; see assets/anims/README.md.
//
// 0: where combo_even ends its cut, high on the right. 12: wound up over
// the right shoulder, as combo at 25. 13 to 17: one key a tick, the cut
// from the right shoulder down to the left, as combo's. 17 is the pose
// combo_even starts from. 27: following through. 45: coming back. 62:
// standing.
